# Agent layer (docs/DOCTRINE.md rule 6 — artifacts out of Git).
# The passthrough caches harness binaries under <tmp>/roblox-external-checks/
# and its probe scratch files here, never in the tree. The one committed
# exception is glass-obsidian/out + preview: the encoder that makes them
# (tools/encode_shots.py) lives in the repo too, so they stay reproducible.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
.ctx-probe.tmp
